{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:21:206","content":{"id":206,"title":"22 T 细胞和 B 细胞的共舞","content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"受体和抗原不是完美结合的，只要 B 细胞的受体可以识别出抗原，就能活化，虽然生成的抗体不完美，但是能快速反应，随后使用精妙的系统微调，改进抗体，变成完美。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"B 细胞被辅助性 T 细胞激活变成浆细胞，每次 B 细胞首要 辅助性 T 细胞的阳性信号，就会进行一轮有目的的突变，体细胞超变（亲和力成熟），生成的抗体随之发生变化。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"过程："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"numbered-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"B 细胞生成抗体后会去战场，如果战争还在继续，就会有大量抗原通过淋巴液"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果改进的抗体变差了，它和抗原结合就会困难，这个 B 细胞会随后自我了断"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果提升了抗原识别能力，就会再次受到激活信号，B 细胞继续改进"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"经过一轮轮筛选，改良最好的 B 细胞能留下来，做后变成浆细胞"}],"disableDrag":false}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这就是面对几十亿能变异的病原体，人体是如何有效应对的，快速适应，改良武器至完美。                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  "}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted"